# Normalise to LF in the repository. CI runs on Linux, development happens on
# Windows, and the scrub gate reads files line by line — inconsistent endings
# would make hit line numbers differ between machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The generated .docx output is a zip container. Never touch it.
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
